diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index e1e0c83..37a7381 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,3 +6,7 @@ The `/documents` endpoint accepts demo tokens `tenant-a-token` and `tenant-b-tok
 request parameters never establish tenant identity. SQLite is disposable test storage.
 Provider and search transports are deterministic, offline injected dependencies.
 Read TASK.md for the behavioral contract and AGENTS.md for the selected architecture.
+
+## Rollback
+
+Knowledge persistence remains in the shared SQLite tables (`documents`, `embeddings`, `deliveries`). To roll back the pack boundary, move `packs/knowledge/app/**` back under `app/`, remove `packs/knowledge`, revert `package.yml` dependencies, and restore direct model access in delivery code. No schema migration is required.
